fixture tech08_attack_cancel_landing
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 8 "Attack-cancel landing: landing never interrupts an attack"; s5 Jump "Landing: 0 f of lag"
room test/flat
frames 40
input
  0..2 jump
  14 attack
end
expect
  at 14 event.attack=1 action=side1 action_frame=1 state=air
  # The strike lands on its frame 6, mid-swing: the landing changes the state, not the strike.
  at 19 event.land=1 state=ground action=side1 action_frame=6 strike=1
  at 20 action=side1 action_frame=7
  at 27 action=side1 action_frame=14
  at 28 action=none
end
